{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00405",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 3.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Alright, hello. Right, let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.74,
      "end_seconds": 7.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Hello. Is it okay if I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.46,
      "end_seconds": 11.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.73,
      "end_seconds": 18.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together. Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.24,
      "end_seconds": 22.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I wanted to get wheezing looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.47,
      "end_seconds": 30.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "Alright, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.52,
      "end_seconds": 36.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly. It's worse with dust. Honestly, once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.23,
      "end_seconds": 43.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 43.43,
      "end_seconds": 47.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "So, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.39,
      "end_seconds": 53.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.53,
      "end_seconds": 61.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "That's fine, one at a time. I'll ask about everything. Has there been a tight chest too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.88,
      "end_seconds": 64.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.64,
      "end_seconds": 67.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Is there anything that triggers it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.79,
      "end_seconds": 81.18,
      "duration_seconds": 12.39,
      "text": "I notice it more with exercise. As for night-time cough, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.07,
      "end_seconds": 84.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.41,
      "end_seconds": 90.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.07,
      "end_seconds": 95.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.49,
      "end_seconds": 97.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.76,
      "end_seconds": 100.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "How often does it happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.83,
      "end_seconds": 103.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Honestly, all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 103.94,
      "end_seconds": 105.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.25,
      "end_seconds": 109.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.29,
      "end_seconds": 112.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Not at all, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 112.98,
      "end_seconds": 117.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.81,
      "end_seconds": 122.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.94,
      "end_seconds": 128.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any chest pain or leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.46,
      "end_seconds": 139.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "No, no chest pain, no leg swelling. I was using my blue inhaler more at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.45,
      "end_seconds": 143.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any runny nose or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.03,
      "end_seconds": 147.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.67,
      "end_seconds": 151.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.3,
      "end_seconds": 153.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.83,
      "end_seconds": 157.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "So, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.37,
      "end_seconds": 161.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.82,
      "end_seconds": 162.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.11,
      "end_seconds": 167.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Yes, I had a knee arthroscopy, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.02,
      "end_seconds": 174.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.23,
      "end_seconds": 183.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Uh, it's Seretide inhaler, twice a day for my asthma. I'm on iron tablets, once a day for my blood count."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.1,
      "end_seconds": 187.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.63,
      "end_seconds": 193.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Nearly five years now. Levetiracetam. I take it 500 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 194.15,
      "end_seconds": 201.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the levetiracetam was 1000 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.28,
      "end_seconds": 204.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.09,
      "end_seconds": 207.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.93,
      "end_seconds": 212.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.32,
      "end_seconds": 220.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "I mean, I've had asthma, yes. I have low haemoglobin. I have epilepsy, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.58,
      "end_seconds": 232.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "text": "Okay, asthma, that's already on your record. Good to know. Okay, low haemoglobin, that's already on your record. Good to know. Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.65,
      "end_seconds": 241.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.79,
      "end_seconds": 243.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.17,
      "end_seconds": 248.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.93,
      "end_seconds": 250.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.94,
      "end_seconds": 259.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.64,
      "end_seconds": 278.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 133 over 84, temperature 37.1. And respiratory rate 22, oxygen saturation is 92 percent, pulse 93."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.81,
      "end_seconds": 284.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.16,
      "end_seconds": 288.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.52,
      "end_seconds": 304.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "You're speaking in full sentences, which is reassuring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.65,
      "end_seconds": 307.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.23,
      "end_seconds": 330.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "I can hear a widespread wheeze on both sides when you breathe out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.94,
      "end_seconds": 358.7,
      "duration_seconds": 25.76,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with an asthma flare-up at this stage. I'd also keep a chest infection in mind. I'd like to arrange breathing tests for asthma. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 359.66,
      "end_seconds": 363.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "We have a slot Monday at 9 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.54,
      "end_seconds": 365.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Okay, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.5,
      "end_seconds": 369.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray for wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.88,
      "end_seconds": 374.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Okay, so sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.72,
      "end_seconds": 388.21,
      "duration_seconds": 12.49,
      "text": "Let's get a peak flow reading, for asthma control. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Let's use prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day, for five days. That's for asthma flare-up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.37,
      "end_seconds": 391.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.66,
      "end_seconds": 398.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Let me watch you use the inhaler, a lot of people don't get the full dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.09,
      "end_seconds": 420.47,
      "duration_seconds": 21.38,
      "text": "Right. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 421.72,
      "end_seconds": 422.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 424.25,
      "end_seconds": 432.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the inhaler isn't helping or you can't speak in full sentences. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 433.11,
      "end_seconds": 434.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 435.17,
      "end_seconds": 436.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Come back in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 437.53,
      "end_seconds": 438.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 439.22,
      "end_seconds": 443.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 444.27,
      "end_seconds": 448.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 449.72,
      "end_seconds": 450.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}